Portions of src/components/ui, src/hooks/use-mobile.ts, src/styles/shadcn.css
and the block-derived console layout originate from shadcn/ui
(https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui), using the official base-nova registry,
sidebar-07 block and shadcn 4.21.4 stylesheet. On 2026-10-10, preset b1Q5GC
was decoded with shadcn 4.21.4 and applied in an isolated Vite scratch copy:
Nova / Base UI, neutral base, blue theme, radius none, IBM Plex Sans,
Lucide, default (solid) menus, subtle menu accent, neutral charts, inherited
heading font. Theme variables and regenerated font-heading classes were
ported; existing equivalent primitives retain local formatting and RTL helpers.
Command, input-group, sonner, chart, select and dropdown-menu sources were
generated from that registry. Chart rendering uses exact-pinned Recharts;
SelectField composes the official Select while retaining native form values.
The command dialog's label is inside its portal for accessibility; the toaster
uses local CSS tokens instead of next-themes. No shadcn CLI, Next.js dependency
or remote font service is required by the product.
Chart color variables use style attributes rather than injected style elements
to preserve the console's strict Content-Security-Policy.

Preset reference: https://ui.shadcn.com/create?preset=b1Q5GC&template=vite
